<title>SOUTH AFRICA: QUICKO CAUTIONS IT IN TALKS.</title>
<headline>QUICKO CAUTIONS IT IN TALKS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quick Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday it was in talks which could have an impact on its share price. </p>
<p>It urged holders to exercise caution in their share dealings pending a further announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
